# Runtime state. Without these, the builder's `COPY . .` pulls guild-settings.json
# (which contains real Discord user ids) into a layer that gets pushed to the
# GitHub Actions build cache. The production stage never copies it, so it does
# not ship - but it has no business being in a shared cache either.
